    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 03/02/2025, the proposal  as shown on the drawings submitted on 03/02/2025 and numbered '39LA//200, 39LA/201, 39LA/02' was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class D of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). The footprint of the proposed porch, measuring 3.1 square metres, exceeds the maximum allowable external floor area of three square metres.\r\n"
